
LunarBridge is independent research. Intel, Apple, Samsung, OpenCore, Lilu and
their contributors do not sponsor or endorse this project.

GPU platform metadata, and now the Xe2 PAT and LRC hardware contracts, are
adapted from MIT-licensed Intel Linux Xe source. The ported modules
(gpu-prototype/lb_xe2_pat.*, gpu-prototype/lb_lrc.*) list their exact source
files, hashes and line citations in docs/ARC_PORT_SOURCES.json.
Apple's newest Intel graphics driver is Ice Lake / Gen11; no Apple driver for
Xe or Xe2 exists, and no Apple driver code or binary is used here.
The VoodooI2C source patch and its independent build now live in the separate
IT-EXPRESS-Bayern/LunarBridge-I2C repository with their original upstream terms.
The exact upstream commits, notices and source hashes are documented here.

No Apple graphics binaries, macOS installer, firmware blob, installed Windows
driver binary, machine ACPI dump, certificate or secret is included.
NootedGreen is discussed as research context only; no code from it is included.
MacKernelSDK remains an external build dependency with its own licenses.
